# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Sort by End Time in scheduling problems.

✅ Merge Intervals requires sorting first.

✅ Platforms use Two Pointers.

✅ Jump Game uses Max Reach.

✅ Jump Game II uses Range Expansion.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Sorting meetings by start time.

❌ Forgetting interval sorting.

❌ Using DP for Jump Game.

❌ Wrong platform counting.

❌ Not merging fully overlapping intervals.

